    {
      "index": 2,
      "tag": "section",
      "heading": "Mission & Vision",
      "textSample": "PURPOSE Mission & Vision The principles that guide every line of code, every design decision, and every client conversation. Our Mission Deliver scalable, reliable, and cost-effective digital solutions while building long-term client partnerships through innovation, quality, and customer-focused development. Our mission is to empower rural communities by reaching users who are still unable to access the opportunities of the digital world and helping them bridge the digital divide. Our Vision To ",
      "className": "bg-[#F7F9FC] py-20 sm:py-24"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "tag": "section",
